              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I make a triple batch without oil and keep it in the refrigerator. Then sprinkle it and oil on the salad when ready to eat. Add a splash of Worcestershire sauce to give it the Columbia 1905 salad taste. Sometimes I’ll use white wine vinegar or balsamic vinegar for a change. The no salt makes this heart healthy for me as long as I am moderate with the oil.",
            "datePublished": "2026-06-10T23:26:47.252Z"
          },
