            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "AndisGr8Lyfe"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Easy peasy to make. I added fresh herbs -- basil, rosemary, and thyme -- to the dried ones in the bottled Italian seasoning. Took the flavor to a whole new, yummy level! Will make it again and again to help reduce my sodium intake.",
