              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jenny Aleman de Bolaos"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a great salad dressing for someone trying to cut the consumption of salt.The flavor its strong so it can make you forget the lacking of saltiness. I give it 4 stars because, on my opinion, the amount of Italian seasoning is too much, I would cut it in half next time. And if you don't need to cut the salt from your diet, just add a little bit as you really don't need much of it.",
